# A pull request adds its changelog entries as a fragment in changelog.d/
# (#602), and `changelog.py release` takes them after those of
# [Unreleased], in the order of the fragments' names, keeps the count of
# #596, and removes the fragments it took; README.md there is not one.
# A fragment that is not subsections of entries is refused before
# anything is written.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && split-file %s %t
# RUN: cd %t/good && %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py fragments | FileCheck --check-prefix=COUNT %s
# RUN: cd %t/good && %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py unreleased | FileCheck --check-prefix=PREVIEW --match-full-lines %s
# RUN: cd %t/good && %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py release 9.9.9 2026-10-27
# RUN: FileCheck --check-prefix=MOVED --match-full-lines %s < %t/good/CHANGELOG.md
# RUN: ls %t/good/changelog.d | FileCheck --check-prefix=LEFT --implicit-check-not=label %s
# RUN: cd %t/bad && not %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py fragments 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=BAD %s
# RUN: cd %t/bad && not %python %S/../../scripts/release/changelog.py release 9.9.9 2026-10-27 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=BAD %s
# RUN: cmp %t/bad/CHANGELOG.md %t/good-original.md
# RUN: ls %t/bad/changelog.d | sort | FileCheck --check-prefix=KEPT %s

# COUNT: 2 fragment(s): ok

# PREVIEW: ### Added
# PREVIEW-EMPTY:
# PREVIEW-NEXT: - Added in the file.
# PREVIEW-NEXT: - Added by a.
# PREVIEW-NEXT: - Added by b,
# PREVIEW-NEXT:   on two lines.
# PREVIEW-EMPTY:
# PREVIEW-NEXT: ### Fixed
# PREVIEW-EMPTY:
# PREVIEW-NEXT: - Fixed by a.

# MOVED: ## [Unreleased]
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ## [9.9.9] - 2026-10-27
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Added
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added in the file.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added by a.
# MOVED-NEXT: - Added by b,
# MOVED-NEXT:   on two lines.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ### Fixed
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: - Fixed by a.
# MOVED-EMPTY:
# MOVED-NEXT: ## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04

# LEFT: README.md

# BAD: changelog.d/b-label.md: '### Bogus' is not one of Added,
# KEPT: a-label.md
# KEPT: b-label.md

#--- good/CHANGELOG.md
# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Added in the file.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04

[Unreleased]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/compare/v0.1.0...HEAD
#--- good/changelog.d/README.md
Not a fragment.
#--- good/changelog.d/a-label.md
### Fixed

- Fixed by a.

### Added

- Added by a.
#--- good/changelog.d/b-label.md
### Added

- Added by b,
  on two lines.
#--- good-original.md
# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Added in the file.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04

[Unreleased]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/compare/v0.1.0...HEAD
#--- bad/CHANGELOG.md
# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Added in the file.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-04

[Unreleased]: https://github.com/vv137/mdir/compare/v0.1.0...HEAD
